#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/numpy_interface/dataset_adapter.py:328
msgid ""
"An array G of shape (n,3) resulted from computing the gradient on a scalar "
"array S of shape (n,) cannot be added together without reshaping. G + "
